
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

read_data       relaxed.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0.027411575 0.0055935808 -0.03912173) to (41.020588 40.62139 42.195122)
  3 by 2 by 5 MPI processor grid
